                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "22abf015-342f-3920-9912-a547401bf2d4",
                        "entry_id": "53b10f42-bcc5-3775-a15f-e320cdfc80e5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "действие или состояние по значению гл. закипать; начало кипения"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bb656e7d-8328-4e26-9df3-dd387b89b77a",
                                "sense_id": "22abf015-342f-3920-9912-a547401bf2d4",
                                "text": "При закипании воды в открытом котелке иглу заполняется туманом настолько, что едва различаются предметы на расстоянии 1 м, но после прекращения кипения туман быстро рассеивается."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "217e19d1-66e2-39a0-afde-04784f09ad3c",
                        "entry_id": "53b10f42-bcc5-3775-a15f-e320cdfc80e5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. возбуждение, усиление, бурное нарастание чего-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "30dfe60c-3e78-472b-80db-59c6bb7fdfb6",
                                "sense_id": "217e19d1-66e2-39a0-afde-04784f09ad3c",
                                "text": "Степан Андреевич почувствовал в себе приятное закипание страсти."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "430a74ae-d924-458c-b8ef-713f5bd71de9",
                        "source_entry_id": "53b10f42-bcc5-3775-a15f-e320cdfc80e5",
                        "source_sense_description": "начало кипения",
                        "target_lang_word": "ebullition",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ebullition",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0cd9ea54-5d43-3626-801b-61b820e1e80a",
                                        "entry_id": "86a1b7f1-490d-38eb-b5b6-64c747b18b12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of boiling."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e073065-d692-4664-8dd7-de61358a8be7",
                                                "sense_id": "0cd9ea54-5d43-3626-801b-61b820e1e80a",
                                                "text": "Suddenly, and at the same moment, the ebullition ceased, and the compound changed to a dark purple, which faded again more slowly to a watery green."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "78fe6222-050b-3508-ac88-fe88a99fbc9f",
                                        "entry_id": "86a1b7f1-490d-38eb-b5b6-64c747b18b12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sudden emotional outburst."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e59a113-7208-4521-9c76-399ae4e3de6a",
                                                "sense_id": "78fe6222-050b-3508-ac88-fe88a99fbc9f",
                                                "text": "His threats—his severe exclamations were but ebullitions of keen vexation, of agony of mind."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d33a74e8-9e75-4d86-905d-d2b13c2f7b86",
                                                "sense_id": "78fe6222-050b-3508-ac88-fe88a99fbc9f",
                                                "text": "Having vented the first ebullition of his wrath, he despatched a message demanding the surrender of the corporal […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca420337-59c4-442d-bd56-f5383f86fac4",
                                                "sense_id": "78fe6222-050b-3508-ac88-fe88a99fbc9f",
                                                "text": "I don't think poor Amelia cared anything about Brienne and Montmirail, or was fairly interested in the war until the abdication of the Emperor; when she clapped her hands and said prayers—oh, how grateful! and flung herself into George Osborne's arms with all her soul, to the astonishment of everybody who witnessed that ebullition of sentiment."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3da849e-8a6b-4349-b187-28763438a6da",
                                                "sense_id": "78fe6222-050b-3508-ac88-fe88a99fbc9f",
                                                "text": "...it is apparent to me that these little ebullitions, or whatever they may be called, of the black guillemots are of a blended nature..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1309088a-8c8f-4d5f-8f0e-37af1fa5a518",
                                                "sense_id": "78fe6222-050b-3508-ac88-fe88a99fbc9f",
                                                "text": "This villa was long and low and white, and severe after its manner : for upon and about it were none of those playful ebullitions of taste, such as conical towers, domed roofs, embattlements, statues, coloured tiles and crenellations, such as are dear to architects of villas all the world over."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9cf2e9b5-58e4-4e5d-a8e8-de157fd22341",
                                                "sense_id": "78fe6222-050b-3508-ac88-fe88a99fbc9f",
                                                "text": "To foreigners we often seem guileless and overchatty, an impression which is dispersed when they find that much of our friendliness is just the ebullition of the moment and does not carry with it any permanence of devotion."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8b11ba05-ea14-4c4a-ab67-2269f3620759",
                        "source_entry_id": "53b10f42-bcc5-3775-a15f-e320cdfc80e5",
                        "source_sense_description": "начало кипения",
                        "target_lang_word": "effervescence",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "effervescence",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05803600-0d05-34b9-9ab8-e270e515b572",
                                        "entry_id": "5a9aba5f-ff54-350c-9993-44b835da10fa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The escape of gas from solution in a liquid, especially the escape of carbon dioxide from a carbonated drink."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e1399e0a-41af-3571-84a1-2e791354d241",
                                        "entry_id": "5a9aba5f-ff54-350c-9993-44b835da10fa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vivacity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b3446f8b-d6a8-3949-bab9-fea635d1c92d",
                                        "entry_id": "5a9aba5f-ff54-350c-9993-44b835da10fa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Foment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a756e1c2-c758-4e54-9953-2da66514ecbb",
                                                "sense_id": "b3446f8b-d6a8-3949-bab9-fea635d1c92d",
                                                "text": "We are in the habit of calling those bodies of men anarchal which are in a state of effervescence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f49b1883-004b-4e30-9e34-ac92bc3b869a",
                        "source_entry_id": "53b10f42-bcc5-3775-a15f-e320cdfc80e5",
                        "source_sense_description": "начало кипения",
                        "target_lang_word": "Aufwallen",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2e10b9c8-6f8f-456a-9261-099a934c12c6",
                        "source_entry_id": "53b10f42-bcc5-3775-a15f-e320cdfc80e5",
                        "source_sense_description": "начало кипения",
                        "target_lang_word": "ébullition",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ébullition",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b6b3b070-7245-38fc-8d2d-f8cfecc64f60",
                                        "entry_id": "c67716d7-7141-333e-9834-40bbd87d4772",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mouvement d’un liquide qui bout sur le feu."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee89ba11-dbb6-47d0-9092-ff974bdcc30f",
                                                "sense_id": "b6b3b070-7245-38fc-8d2d-f8cfecc64f60",
                                                "text": "Traitées par des acides dilués en ébullition elles donnent de l’urée et des corps à fonction amine et acides (amino-acides) tel que le glycocolle CH₂AzH₂.CO₂H, la tyrosine amino-acide aromatique, etc."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5496f65f-7730-4532-b519-9a1cd4a771ce",
                                                "sense_id": "b6b3b070-7245-38fc-8d2d-f8cfecc64f60",
                                                "text": "Une bourre de soie sèche, telle qu’on l'obtient par la longue ébullition avec une grande quantité de détergent, comme à l’ordinaire, ne contient que 5% de séricine."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "de3d15e1-1fc9-3126-9368-5918a919cf34",
                                        "entry_id": "c67716d7-7141-333e-9834-40bbd87d4772",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mouvements d’une personne ou d'une foule qui s’échauffe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "analogy",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13c5b15d-c802-48e2-bbe7-0b1a409fd563",
                                                "sense_id": "de3d15e1-1fc9-3126-9368-5918a919cf34",
                                                "text": "Ces années-là, le monde du travail est en ébullition. On sait désormais que l’atelier et la mine peuvent tuer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe7d1410-5293-4260-9206-7abbc4d78c0c",
                                                "sense_id": "de3d15e1-1fc9-3126-9368-5918a919cf34",
                                                "text": "Débatteur infatigable au cerveau perpétuellement en ébullition, le député arpentait depuis des semaines les couloirs de toutes les institutions avec ses nombreux dossiers sous le bras."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "85c32e4c-08ae-36ef-bd47-a481fa973b94",
                                        "entry_id": "c67716d7-7141-333e-9834-40bbd87d4772",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "En chaleur ; en état d’excitation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "analogy",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a89124b-79de-406a-8071-1044eaff04b5",
                                                "sense_id": "85c32e4c-08ae-36ef-bd47-a481fa973b94",
                                                "text": "Je n’ose imaginer l’état de mes finances si je devais, en plus de ces difficultés, subvenir aux besoins irréfléchis d’une femme ! Guibert le regrette tous les jours, lui qui s’est laissé embarquer par un fessier en ébullition."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7cea0433-e662-33d9-9aff-0e0953a3f050",
                                        "entry_id": "c67716d7-7141-333e-9834-40bbd87d4772",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Troubles physiques provoqués par une forte émotion ou la colère."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "938646b2-1d08-4cbb-867f-69f3f21a4f60",
                                                "sense_id": "7cea0433-e662-33d9-9aff-0e0953a3f050",
                                                "text": "Il avait des transports et des ébullitions de sang au cerveau, surtout quand il s’absorbait dans ses pensées de deuil, ou s’appliquait à une tâche un peu difficile. Sa vue alors se troublait. Il vacillait comme un homme ivre, et pour ne pas tomber, il cherchait machinalement un appui."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
